// (/dashboard/calendar).
//
// Every action authenticates the caller (`requireUser`, via `resolveMailbox`),
// resolves ONLY a mailbox the caller owns, decrypts its stored credential, and
// talks to the customer's SOGo CalDAV over the mail server — reusing the SAME
// per-user mailbox credential the webmail client uses. Mutating actions are
// rate-limited and validate their input. The password never leaves the server.
//
// Signatures are fixed by lib/calendar/types.ts — the UI builds against the same
// contract, so do not change them here.

